    link: 'https://www.canva.com/design/DAF5q7j1Ftg/z2VgSkKYFDED3hiYx6DSig/view',
    description: 'Deep dive into advanced Git concepts: forking, issues, CLI mastery, remotes, and open source contribution workflows.',
