    description: 'Introduction to C++ Standard Template Library. Covered why STL matters, containers, iterators, algorithms, sequential/ordered/unordered containers, headers, pair, vector, map, set, stack, queue, and ordered vs unordered & multiset/multimap with hands-on coding.',
